### Criar atendente 
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Atendente", "username": "atendente", "email": "atendente@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456", "isAdmin": false }

### Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login atendente
# @name loginAtendente
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "atendente@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Listar categorias sem token (esperado 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/categories

### Listar categorias como atendente (esperado 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAtendente.response.body.accessToken}}

### Criar categoria como atendente (esperado 403)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAtendente.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Terror {{$randomInt 1000 9999}}" }

### Criar categoria como admin (esperado 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Terror {{$randomInt 1000 9999}}" }

### Criar leitor como atendente (esperado 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/readers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAtendente.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Joao Souza", "cpf": "{{$randomInt 100000 999999}}", "email": "joao{{$randomInt 100 999}}@email.com", "phone": "44999990000" }